{"messages":[{"content":"Graph contract: kind=graph. nodes contains distinct strings. edges contains [from,to,cost] triples with positive integer fuel costs and at most one edge per ordered pair. start and goal are nodes; fuel is a nonnegative integer. plan is an ordered list of destination node names. Every edge is directed. Start at {node:start,fuel:fuel}. An action is legal exactly when an edge from the current node to its destination exists and its cost is at most the remaining fuel. A legal move changes node to its destination and subtracts the edge cost. At the first illegal action, include that action's {legal:false,after:unchanged_state} step, stop immediately, and do not evaluate subsequent actions. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed action was legal. reaches_goal is true exactly when the whole plan is valid and its terminal node is goal, including an initially satisfied goal with an empty plan. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL state that reaches goal within initial fuel, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the entire destination-name sequence. It is [] for an initially satisfied goal and null if no feasible plan exists. Fuel cost is a feasibility constraint, not the optimization objective. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:{node:string,fuel:integer}}], after:{node:string,fuel:integer}, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"plan\":[\"Obsidian\",\"Tundra\",\"Umber\",\"Zephyr\",\"Nacre\",\"Quasar\",\"Vesper\"],\"fuel\":19,\"goal\":\"Vesper\",\"start\":\"Sirocco\",\"edges\":[[\"Sirocco\",\"Obsidian\",4],[\"Obsidian\",\"Tundra\",4],[\"Tundra\",\"Umber\",1],[\"Umber\",\"Zephyr\",3],[\"Zephyr\",\"Nacre\",3],[\"Nacre\",\"Quasar\",2],[\"Quasar\",\"Vesper\",3],[\"Sirocco\",\"Vesper\",20]],\"nodes\":[\"Sirocco\",\"Obsidian\",\"Tundra\",\"Umber\",\"Zephyr\",\"Nacre\",\"Quasar\",\"Vesper\"],\"kind\":\"graph\"}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"fuel\":2,\"node\":\"Quasar\"},\"reaches_goal\":false,\"shortest_plan\":null,\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"fuel\":15,\"node\":\"Obsidian\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":11,\"node\":\"Tundra\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":10,\"node\":\"Umber\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":7,\"node\":\"Zephyr\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":4,\"node\":\"Nacre\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":2,\"node\":\"Quasar\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":2,\"node\":\"Quasar\"},\"legal\":false}],\"valid\":false}","role":"assistant"}]}
{"messages":[{"content":"Graph contract: kind=graph. nodes contains distinct strings. edges contains [from,to,cost] triples with positive integer fuel costs and at most one edge per ordered pair. start and goal are nodes; fuel is a nonnegative integer. plan is an ordered list of destination node names. Every edge is directed. Start at {node:start,fuel:fuel}. An action is legal exactly when an edge from the current node to its destination exists and its cost is at most the remaining fuel. A legal move changes node to its destination and subtracts the edge cost. At the first illegal action, include that action's {legal:false,after:unchanged_state} step, stop immediately, and do not evaluate subsequent actions. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed action was legal. reaches_goal is true exactly when the whole plan is valid and its terminal node is goal, including an initially satisfied goal with an empty plan. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL state that reaches goal within initial fuel, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the entire destination-name sequence. It is [] for an initially satisfied goal and null if no feasible plan exists. Fuel cost is a feasibility constraint, not the optimization objective. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:{node:string,fuel:integer}}], after:{node:string,fuel:integer}, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"graph\",\"nodes\":[\"Sirocco\",\"Obsidian\",\"Tundra\",\"Umber\",\"Zephyr\",\"Nacre\",\"Quasar\",\"Vesper\"],\"edges\":[[\"Sirocco\",\"Obsidian\",4],[\"Obsidian\",\"Tundra\",4],[\"Tundra\",\"Umber\",1],[\"Umber\",\"Zephyr\",3],[\"Zephyr\",\"Nacre\",3],[\"Nacre\",\"Quasar\",2],[\"Quasar\",\"Vesper\",3],[\"Sirocco\",\"Vesper\",20]],\"start\":\"Sirocco\",\"goal\":\"Vesper\",\"fuel\":41,\"plan\":[\"Vesper\"]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"fuel\":21,\"node\":\"Vesper\"},\"reaches_goal\":true,\"shortest_plan\":[\"Vesper\"],\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"fuel\":21,\"node\":\"Vesper\"},\"legal\":true}],\"valid\":true}","role":"assistant"}]}
{"messages":[{"content":"Graph contract: kind=graph. nodes contains distinct strings. edges contains [from,to,cost] triples with positive integer fuel costs and at most one edge per ordered pair. start and goal are nodes; fuel is a nonnegative integer. plan is an ordered list of destination node names. Every edge is directed. Start at {node:start,fuel:fuel}. An action is legal exactly when an edge from the current node to its destination exists and its cost is at most the remaining fuel. A legal move changes node to its destination and subtracts the edge cost. At the first illegal action, include that action's {legal:false,after:unchanged_state} step, stop immediately, and do not evaluate subsequent actions. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed action was legal. reaches_goal is true exactly when the whole plan is valid and its terminal node is goal, including an initially satisfied goal with an empty plan. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL state that reaches goal within initial fuel, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the entire destination-name sequence. It is [] for an initially satisfied goal and null if no feasible plan exists. Fuel cost is a feasibility constraint, not the optimization objective. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:{node:string,fuel:integer}}], after:{node:string,fuel:integer}, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"plan\":[\"Vesper\"],\"fuel\":41,\"goal\":\"Vesper\",\"start\":\"Sirocco\",\"edges\":[[\"Sirocco\",\"Obsidian\",4],[\"Obsidian\",\"Tundra\",4],[\"Tundra\",\"Umber\",1],[\"Umber\",\"Zephyr\",3],[\"Zephyr\",\"Nacre\",3],[\"Nacre\",\"Quasar\",2],[\"Quasar\",\"Vesper\",3],[\"Sirocco\",\"Vesper\",20]],\"nodes\":[\"Sirocco\",\"Obsidian\",\"Tundra\",\"Umber\",\"Zephyr\",\"Nacre\",\"Quasar\",\"Vesper\"],\"kind\":\"graph\"}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"fuel\":21,\"node\":\"Vesper\"},\"reaches_goal\":true,\"shortest_plan\":[\"Vesper\"],\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"fuel\":21,\"node\":\"Vesper\"},\"legal\":true}],\"valid\":true}","role":"assistant"}]}
{"messages":[{"content":"Blocks contract: kind=blocks. on maps each distinct block name to a support block or TABLE. TABLE is reserved, supports must exist, and self-support, cycles, or more than one block directly on a block are malformed. TABLE may support several blocks. goal_on is a partial map using existing blocks or TABLE; self-support, cycles, and multiple blocks directly assigned to one block are contradictory and malformed. The initial state and goals here are well-formed. A block is clear when no block is directly on it. plan is an ordered list of {block,to} actions. A move is legal exactly when block exists and is clear, to is TABLE or an existing clear block distinct from block, and to differs from block's current support. A legal move changes only that block's support. At the first illegal move, include its {legal:false,after:unchanged_on_map} step, stop immediately, and ignore subsequent moves. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed move was legal. reaches_goal means the entire plan is valid and every goal_on entry equals the final on-map entry; unspecified supports need not change. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL on-map that satisfies every goal_on entry, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the complete sequence of (block,to) string pairs. It is [] when the initial state already satisfies the goal and null if unreachable. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:on_map}], after:on_map, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"blocks\",\"on\":{\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\",\"ruby\":\"sapphire\",\"quartz\":\"ruby\",\"pearl\":\"quartz\",\"onyx\":\"pearl\"},\"goal_on\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"sapphire\":\"ruby\",\"ruby\":\"quartz\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\"},\"plan\":[{\"block\":\"onyx\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"pearl\",\"to\":\"onyx\"},{\"block\":\"quartz\",\"to\":\"pearl\"},{\"block\":\"ruby\",\"to\":\"quartz\"},{\"block\":\"sapphire\",\"to\":\"ruby\"},{\"block\":\"sapphire\",\"to\":\"ruby\"}]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"quartz\",\"sapphire\":\"ruby\"},\"reaches_goal\":false,\"shortest_plan\":[{\"block\":\"onyx\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"pearl\",\"to\":\"onyx\"},{\"block\":\"quartz\",\"to\":\"pearl\"},{\"block\":\"ruby\",\"to\":\"quartz\"},{\"block\":\"sapphire\",\"to\":\"ruby\"}],\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"quartz\",\"quartz\":\"ruby\",\"ruby\":\"sapphire\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"ruby\",\"ruby\":\"sapphire\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"sapphire\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"quartz\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"quartz\",\"sapphire\":\"ruby\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"quartz\",\"sapphire\":\"ruby\"},\"legal\":false}],\"valid\":false}","role":"assistant"}]}
{"messages":[{"content":"Blocks contract: kind=blocks. on maps each distinct block name to a support block or TABLE. TABLE is reserved, supports must exist, and self-support, cycles, or more than one block directly on a block are malformed. TABLE may support several blocks. goal_on is a partial map using existing blocks or TABLE; self-support, cycles, and multiple blocks directly assigned to one block are contradictory and malformed. The initial state and goals here are well-formed. A block is clear when no block is directly on it. plan is an ordered list of {block,to} actions. A move is legal exactly when block exists and is clear, to is TABLE or an existing clear block distinct from block, and to differs from block's current support. A legal move changes only that block's support. At the first illegal move, include its {legal:false,after:unchanged_on_map} step, stop immediately, and ignore subsequent moves. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed move was legal. reaches_goal means the entire plan is valid and every goal_on entry equals the final on-map entry; unspecified supports need not change. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL on-map that satisfies every goal_on entry, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the complete sequence of (block,to) string pairs. It is [] when the initial state already satisfies the goal and null if unreachable. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:on_map}], after:on_map, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"plan\":[{\"to\":\"TABLE\",\"block\":\"onyx\"},{\"to\":\"onyx\",\"block\":\"pearl\"},{\"to\":\"pearl\",\"block\":\"quartz\"},{\"to\":\"quartz\",\"block\":\"ruby\"},{\"to\":\"ruby\",\"block\":\"sapphire\"},{\"to\":\"ruby\",\"block\":\"sapphire\"}],\"goal_on\":{\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"quartz\",\"sapphire\":\"ruby\",\"onyx\":\"TABLE\"},\"on\":{\"onyx\":\"pearl\",\"pearl\":\"quartz\",\"quartz\":\"ruby\",\"ruby\":\"sapphire\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"kind\":\"blocks\"}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"quartz\",\"sapphire\":\"ruby\"},\"reaches_goal\":false,\"shortest_plan\":[{\"block\":\"onyx\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"pearl\",\"to\":\"onyx\"},{\"block\":\"quartz\",\"to\":\"pearl\"},{\"block\":\"ruby\",\"to\":\"quartz\"},{\"block\":\"sapphire\",\"to\":\"ruby\"}],\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"quartz\",\"quartz\":\"ruby\",\"ruby\":\"sapphire\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"ruby\",\"ruby\":\"sapphire\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"sapphire\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"quartz\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"quartz\",\"sapphire\":\"ruby\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"onyx\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"quartz\",\"sapphire\":\"ruby\"},\"legal\":false}],\"valid\":false}","role":"assistant"}]}
